      "path": "tests/integration/d5r/support.ts",
      "content": "`tradeId` is now unused in `saveMarksFrom`, but callers still supply it as though it scopes the save to a card. Remove that parameter and update the call sites so the helper reflects the new page-wide contract rather than silently ignoring a supplied Trade.",
