    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "The page-wide save now returns the first Trade in the refreshed order, not necessarily the open Trade, but `marksSaved` still unconditionally replaces the open card with `post.trade` when its opening matches. Saving while a different walked card is open (or when saving reorders the Trades) therefore switches cards unexpectedly and can unmount unsaved Action/reflection inputs. Apply the returned overview independently, and refresh/preserve the open Trade rather than treating `post.trade` as its refreshed detail. Add a test where the open Trade differs from the first Trade returned.",
      "existing_code": "    const result = await facade.DailyReview.save({ kind: 'SaveReviewMarks', reviewDate: from.reviewDate, binding: from.binding, entries });",
